{{ 'section-main-faq.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="nbjc-editorial-page nbjc-shipping-page color-scheme-1 gradient">
  <div class="nbjc-editorial-page__inner page-width">
    <header class="nbjc-editorial-page__header">
      <h1>Shipping &amp; Returns</h1>
      <p>
        Clear answers for processing times, shipping, returns,<br class="nbjc-editorial-page__desktop-break">
        and the occasional mail-route side quest.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Processing Time</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          Orders are typically prepared and handed off for shipping within
          <strong>3&ndash;7 business days</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          During busier seasons, processing may take a little longer, but your order
          will still be handled as quickly and carefully as possible.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Shipping</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          Sticker orders are shipped to the address provided at checkout. Please double-check
          your shipping address before placing your order, especially apartment numbers,
          unit numbers, and auto-filled addresses.
        </p>
        <p>
          Once your order has shipped, delivery timing depends on the shipping carrier
          and destination.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Tracking</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          If tracking is included with your shipping method, you&rsquo;ll receive tracking
          information once your order is on its way.
        </p>
        <p>
          Please allow a little time for tracking updates to appear after the label is created.
          Sometimes the system needs a moment to catch up, which feels emotionally familiar.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Lost or Delayed Mail</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          If your order seems delayed, please allow a few extra business days for the carrier
          to update or deliver it. Mail can occasionally take scenic routes.
        </p>
        <p>
          If your order appears lost or hasn&rsquo;t arrived after a reasonable amount of time,
          reach out through the contact form with your order number, and I&rsquo;ll help look into it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Returns &amp; Exchanges</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          Because stickers are small printed goods, returns and exchanges are generally
          not accepted unless there is an issue with the order.
        </p>
        <p>
          Please contact me if your order arrives damaged, incorrect, or missing an item.
          I&rsquo;ll do my best to make it right.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Damaged or Incorrect Orders</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          If something arrives damaged or incorrect, please reach out within
          <strong>7 days of delivery</strong> with:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your order number</li>
          <li>A brief description of the issue</li>
          <li>A clear photo of the damaged or incorrect item</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This helps me review the situation quickly and find the best next step.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Cancellations</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          If you need to cancel an order, please reach out as soon as possible.
        </p>
        <p>
          If the order has not entered processing or shipped yet, I&rsquo;ll do my best to help.
          Once an order has shipped, it can&rsquo;t be canceled.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Address Issues</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          Orders sent to an incorrect address provided at checkout may not be eligible
          for replacement or refund.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you notice an address mistake after ordering, contact me right away.
          If the order has not shipped yet, I may be able to update it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-section">
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__label">
        <span>Questions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nbjc-policy-section__content">
        <p>
          If something looks off, confusing, delayed, or mildly cursed, send a message
          with your order number and I&rsquo;ll help from there.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="nbjc-policy-callout">
      <div>
        <h2>Still need help?</h2>
        <p>
          Send a message with your order number if you have one.<br>
          Small shop. Actual replies.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="nbjc-policy-callout__button">Contact</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shipping returns page",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section nbjc-shipping-section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Shipping returns page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
